{"recipes": [{"rid": "grives-01", "sid": "grives", "title": "Grives à la Broche", "title_ja": "つぐみの串焼き", "paragraphs": ["(Voyez l’article _Bécasses à la Broche_)."], "paragraphs_ja": [], "changes": [[]], "spans": [[{"s": 1, "e": 6, "c": "action"}, {"s": 18, "e": 26, "c": "ingredient"}, {"s": 32, "e": 38, "c": "vessel"}]], "refs": [[{"s": 17, "e": 39, "name": "Bécasses à la Broche", "to": null, "status": "unresolved"}]], "reference_only": true}, {"rid": "grives-02", "sid": "grives", "title": "Grives à la Flamande", "title_ja": "フランドル風のつぐみ", "paragraphs": ["Épluchez et retroussez ces grives, sans les vider; mettez-les dans une casserole avec un morceau de beurre et une pincée de graine de genièvre; saupoudrez-les d’un peu de sel; sautez-les; faites-leur prendre couleur; couvrez votre casserole; mettez un peu de feu dessous et dessus; faites-les cuire un peu vertes, et servez-les avec leur assaisonnement."], "paragraphs_ja": [], "changes": [[]], "spans": [[{"s": 0, "e": 8, "c": "action"}, {"s": 12, "e": 22, "c": "action"}, {"s": 27, "e": 33, "c": "ingredient"}, {"s": 51, "e": 57, "c": "action"}, {"s": 67, "e": 70, "c": "quantity"}, {"s": 71, "e": 80, "c": "vessel"}, {"s": 86, "e": 88, "c": "quantity"}, {"s": 89, "e": 96, "c": "quantity"}, {"s": 100, "e": 106, "c": "ingredient"}, {"s": 110, "e": 113, "c": "quantity"}, {"s": 114, "e": 120, "c": "quantity"}, {"s": 144, "e": 154, "c": "action"}, {"s": 161, "e": 163, "c": "quantity"}, {"s": 171, "e": 174, "c": "ingredient"}, {"s": 176, "e": 182, "c": "action"}, {"s": 217, "e": 224, "c": "action"}, {"s": 231, "e": 240, "c": "vessel"}, {"s": 242, "e": 248, "c": "action"}, {"s": 249, "e": 251, "c": "quantity"}, {"s": 259, "e": 262, "c": "heat"}, {"s": 293, "e": 298, "c": "action"}, {"s": 299, "e": 301, "c": "quantity"}, {"s": 317, "e": 323, "c": "action"}]], "refs": [[]], "reference_only": false}, {"rid": "grives-03", "sid": "grives", "title": "Grives à l’Anglaise", "title_ja": "イギリス風のつぐみ", "paragraphs": ["Épluchez et retroussez vos grives sans les vider; embrochez-les avec un hatelet, posez cet hatelet sur une broche et fixez-la des deux bouts; enveloppez vos grives de papier; faites-les cuire à moitié; ôtez leur papier; mettez un morceau de lard au bout d’un hatelet; faites prendre le feu à votre lard, et durant qu’il brûle faites-le dégoutter sur vos grives; saupoudrez-les d’un peu de sel fin et de mie de pain; donnez-leur une belle couleur; dressez-les, et servez à côté une sauce au pauvre homme, liée avec un morceau de beurre. (Voyez l’article _Sauce au pauvre Homme_.)"], "paragraphs_ja": [], "changes": [[{"s": 72, "e": 79, "old": "hatelet", "new": "hâtelet", "k": "lexicon"}, {"s": 91, "e": 98, "old": "hatelet", "new": "hâtelet", "k": "lexicon"}, {"s": 259, "e": 266, "old": "hatelet", "new": "hâtelet", "k": "lexicon"}]], "spans": [[{"s": 0, "e": 8, "c": "action"}, {"s": 12, "e": 22, "c": "action"}, {"s": 27, "e": 33, "c": "ingredient"}, {"s": 50, "e": 59, "c": "action"}, {"s": 69, "e": 71, "c": "quantity"}, {"s": 72, "e": 79, "c": "vessel"}, {"s": 81, "e": 86, "c": "action"}, {"s": 91, "e": 98, "c": "vessel"}, {"s": 103, "e": 106, "c": "quantity"}, {"s": 107, "e": 113, "c": "vessel"}, {"s": 117, "e": 122, "c": "action"}, {"s": 130, "e": 134, "c": "quantity"}, {"s": 142, "e": 152, "c": "action"}, {"s": 157, "e": 163, "c": "ingredient"}, {"s": 167, "e": 173, "c": "vessel"}, {"s": 186, "e": 191, "c": "action"}, {"s": 194, "e": 200, "c": "quantity"}, {"s": 202, "e": 206, "c": "action"}, {"s": 212, "e": 218, "c": "vessel"}, {"s": 220, "e": 226, "c": "action"}, {"s": 227, "e": 229, "c": "quantity"}, {"s": 230, "e": 237, "c": "quantity"}, {"s": 241, "e": 245, "c": "ingredient"}, {"s": 256, "e": 258, "c": "quantity"}, {"s": 259, "e": 266, "c": "vessel"}, {"s": 286, "e": 289, "c": "heat"}, {"s": 298, "e": 302, "c": "ingredient"}, {"s": 354, "e": 360, "c": "ingredient"}, {"s": 362, "e": 372, "c": "action"}, {"s": 379, "e": 381, "c": "quantity"}, {"s": 389, "e": 392, "c": "ingredient"}, {"s": 